  "prefLabel": "Rev 1802.03 Appeals",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Rev 1802.03 Appeals. A landowner may appeal the decision made pursuant to Rev 1802.01 (f) within 180 days from the date of decision by filing with:\n\n(a) The New Hampshire board of tax and land appeals pursuant to RSA 79 B:5; or\n\n(b) The New Hampshire superior court within the county where the property is located pursuant to RSA 79 B:5.\n\nSource. #8567, eff 2-14-06; ss by #10560, eff 3-28-14; ss by #13867, eff 2-8-24",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/rev1800.html"
